# The bridge reads everything the devices publish.
user bridge
topic read coldmonitor/+/readings
topic read coldmonitor/+/status

# An operator account that can change device settings (retained config messages).
user admin
topic readwrite coldmonitor/#

# Every other user is a device whose user name is its device id (%u): it can only publish its own readings and
# status and read its own config, so a stolen device password cannot fake readings for another freezer.
pattern write coldmonitor/%u/readings
pattern write coldmonitor/%u/status
pattern read coldmonitor/%u/config
